SOAPBOX: Conditions seemed notably poorer than the past few years. I found 40 to be
SOAPBOX: particularly so with many EU DX calling CQ and just not hearing me. The other bands
SOAPBOX: were similar but not so poor and disappointing. Very little this time on 10
SOAPBOX: though.
SOAPBOX: Hopefully next month’s CW segment will be more successful. Having he DX
SOAPBOX: call (PJ7UK) and being further away from the magnetic poles certainly won’t
SOAPBOX: hurt!
